tate. UiThread.MarkCurrentThreadAsUiThread, which every platform host reaches from its pump, marks the UI thread. ParallelInlineOnMarkedThreadTests and UiThreadPumpIdentityTests.ThePumpThreadRunsParallelLoopsInline pin both. Browser frame-tick tests run their ticks on a dedicated thread so no test leaves a pool worker marked.","ai_tool":"Claude"},{"repo_name":"DataDog/build-plugins","commit_timestamp":"2026-10-02T23:03:48Z","branch":"master","commit_sha":"d0dec913b956486628de84364860440503b9280c","github_link":"https://github.com/DataDog/build-plugins/commit/d0dec913b956486628de84364860440503b9280c","commit_subject":"fix(live-debugger): bump picomatch to 4.0.7","ai_tool":"Claude"},{"repo_name":"marko-js/marko","commit_timestamp":"2026-10-02T23:03:43Z","branch":"main","commit_sha":"67a4665d043b1130a5718f662412334630f0be62","github_link":"https://github.com/marko-js/marko/commit/67a4665d043b1130a5718f662412334630f0be62","commit_subject":"fix(runtime-tags): read a hoisted tag variable only through its getter","ai_tool":"Claude"},{"repo_name":"vtex/faststore","commit_timestamp":"2026-10-02T23:03:41Z","branch":"dev","commit_sha":"3c58a213d237f8d5f7919ab12f63015fbfe3ef73","github_link":"https://github.com/vtex/faststore/commit/3c58a213d237f8d5f7919ab12f63015fbfe3ef73","commit_subject":"fix(core): keep UI session state out of session and cart mutations (#3511)","ai_tool":"Claude"},{"repo_name":"reatom/reatom","commit_timestamp":"2026-10-02T23:03:39Z","branch":"v1001","commit_sha":"b48778e3bf3a80d85b176157b094c2470d0ab86e","github_link":"https://github.com/reatom/reatom/commit/b48778e3bf3a80d85b176157b094c2470d0ab86e","commit_subject":"fix(tanstack-start-ssr): bump @tanstack/react-start to patched 1.168.60","ai_tool":"Cursor"},{"repo_name":"goaop/framework","commit_timestamp":"2026-10-02T23:03:30Z","branch":"master","commit_sha":"5bc99a4698aa5f2dc09a6cec93e2a5906e9a9a7a","github_link":"https://github.com/goaop/framework/commit/5bc99a4698aa5f2dc09a6cec93e2a5906e9a9a7a","comm